{"availability":"available","full":"Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-mobile-automation","name":"mydemoapp-mobile-automation","description":"Android mobile test automation for Sauce Labs' My Demo App: Appium (UiAutomator2) + Python + pytest + Allure, Page Object Model, 62 test cases from exploratory testing, 8 real defects as strict xfails, CI on an Android emulator in GitHub Actions","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T16:25:17Z","updated":"2026-10-05T10:41:44Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://anusreepsuresh074.github.io/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/","topics":["allure","android","appium","github-actions","mobile-testing","pytest","python","qa-automation","test-automation","uiautomator2"],"demo":"https://anusreepsuresh074.github.io/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.481Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.481Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.481Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.481Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Automated end-to-end tests for Sauce Labs' My Demo App, a public practice shopping app for Android, written in Python + pytest with Appium (UiAutomator2) and reported in Allure. They cover the whole shopping journey (catalogue, sorting, product details, cart, sign-in and sign-out, checkout with address, payment and review) and how the app behaves on a phone (Back button, background, rotation, restart).","62 test cases (28 positive, 18 negative, 16 edge), 43 of them found through six exploratory testing sessions, built with the Page Object Model from locators confirmed on the running app. The smoke suite runs on every push and the full regression nightly, on an Android emulator in GitHub Actions. 8 real app defects were found, including a crash and two security issues, and are kept visible as strict xfails.","Full results, defects and open items: docs/test-summary-report.md. Exploratory session notes and evidence: docs/exploratory/."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3bcc01bc873aecee525fc9274f98cd48f9db9bfe32eefb5c2a1b1523e3af57a2","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.659Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.659Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Automated end-to-end tests for Sauce Labs' My Demo App, a public practice shopping app for Android, written in Python + pytest with Appium (UiAutomator2) and reported in Allure. They cover the whole shopping journey (catalogue, sorting, product details, cart, sign-in and sign-out, checkout with address, payment and review) and how the app behaves on a phone (Back button, background, rotation, restart).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"They cover the whole shopping journey (catalogue, sorting, product details, cart, sign-in and sign-out, checkout with address, payment and review) and how the app behaves on a phone (Back button, background, rotation, restart).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"CI copies .env.example to .env, and the run script loaded it on top of the environment, replacing the login secrets with empty placeholders.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3bcc01bc873aecee525fc9274f98cd48f9db9bfe32eefb5c2a1b1523e3af57a2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-mobile-automation/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:18.659Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T10:41:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anusreepsuresh074/mydemoapp-